    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "phases_body",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 76,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "init(): forward order\n  each component initializes\n  failure → reverse terminate\n  already-initialized components\n\npost_init(): forward order\n  cross-component deps resolved\n  background tasks started\n  registry lookup available\n\npre_terminate(): reverse order\n  bg tasks that need other\n  components shut down first\n\nterminate(): reverse order\n  final cleanup per component\n  warns on leaked Arc refs\n\nEventBus:\n  startup before init\n  shutdown after terminate",
      "originalText": "init(): forward order\n  each component initializes\n  failure → reverse terminate\n  already-initialized components\n\npost_init(): forward order\n  cross-component deps resolved\n  background tasks started\n  registry lookup available\n\npre_terminate(): reverse order\n  bg tasks that need other\n  components shut down first\n\nterminate(): reverse order\n  final cleanup per component\n  warns on leaked Arc refs\n\nEventBus:\n  startup before init\n  shutdown after terminate",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
