      "x": 25,
      "y": 383,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 95,
      "text": "ProtectedStore: OS keychain (native) / localStorage (wasm) · device encryption key · insecure fallback option\nCrypto: VLD0 Ed25519/X25519 + VLD1 ML-DSA/ML-KEM · DH cache · envelope encrypt/decrypt · receipt signing\nTableStore: encrypted SQLite (native) / IndexedDB (wasm) · table cleanup · flush tasks · max_value_size_mb: 64\nRoutingTable: Kademlia k-buckets · route_spec_store (allocate/compile/test/validate) · routing_domain controllers · peer health tasks\nStorageManager: DHT record CRUD · watch (outbound_watch_manager) · transactions (outbound_transaction_manager) · offline writes · schema enforcement\nNetworkManager: TCP/UDP/WS/WebRTC connections · bootstrap (DNS TXT + direct) · address detection · relay worker · connection table · VICE NAT\nRPCProcessor: Cap'n Proto encode/decode · fanout_call (Kademlia iterative) · operation_waiter · app_call/app_message RPC handlers\nAttachmentManager: attach/detach state machine · background tick (peer refresh, route mgmt, DHT maintenance, watch reconciliation, connection cleanup)",
